vielotus (2.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.0.3 (incorporating 2.0.2 and 2.0.3 changes):
    - SEN Flex Policy 3B+ mark-only backspace (duocw + Backspace -> được),
      Telex horn propagation (dduwocj -> được, huwou -> hươu), tone-mark
      replacement and expressive vowel repeats (uwfaaa -> ừaaa), post-coda
      circumflex English preservation (theme vs theem -> thêm), ee/oo
      code-switching in English context, double-letter and camelCase English
      preservation (dessert, queue, saveFile), and "pía" syllable support.
    - Guard Wayland delete_surrounding_text bounds, harden KDE Plasma 6 Wayland
      virtual keyboard binding and GNOME input-source repair, and update
      Arch/rolling-release Linux CMake build support.
    - Native C++20 regression suite: 100.00% (9,091/9,091) primary,
      100.00% (373/373) ambiguous_both_sides, 100.00% (180/180)
      whitelist_safe=never. Swift regression suite: 100.00% (9,091/9,091)
      primary, 97.86% (365/373) ambiguous_both_sides, 100.00% (180/180)
      whitelist_safe=never.
  * Address packaging review items from 2.0.1-1 and tracker diagnostics:
    - Use mktemp -d (0700) with exit trap in vielotus-settings instead of a
      predictable /tmp path.
    - Drop redundant Recommends on the vielotus metapackage and ship
      /usr/bin/vielotus plus vielotus.1 manpage symlinks.
    - Update debian/watch to Version 5 and set Vcs-Git subpath
      [CrossPlatform/packaging] for vcswatch.
    - Replace legacy encoded arrays in VietnameseSyllableDictionary.swift and
      EmbeddedTestSuite.swift with plain UTF-8 source (DFSG #2), and add
      complete DEP-5 SCOWL attribution to debian/copyright.

 -- Trần Phát Đạt (Steve Dat) <ttd1232004@gmail.com>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:10:00 +0700

vielotus (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. (Closes: #1152533)
  * Official multi-arch (amd64 & arm64) release of Sen Việt (VieLotusIM).
  * Unobfuscated C++20 native engine with canonical UTF-8 (Unicode NFC)
    lexicon wordlists and build-time FNV-1a table generation (DFSG #2).
  * Native Fcitx5 addon (vielotus-telex, vielotus-vni) and IBus engine.
  * Ubuntu Language Support auto-registration for Vietnamese (vi).

